## Current Secrets Inventory

### Secrets Defined in `.env.test`

| Variable | Value Pattern | Type | Risk Level | Used by App |
|----------|---------------|------|------------|-------------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | `postgres://admin:CANARY-db-secret-7f3a@db.internal:5432/production` | Database Connection | 🔴 CRITICAL | ❌ NO |
